  "prefLabel": "He-P 3013.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3013.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish the requirements of a maternal mortality review panel in order to carry out the provisions established in RSA 132:30, VII.\n\nSource. #10287, eff 3-16-13",
